Significantly, the title of the article has been changed and it has now been submitted as a Research Note, rather than its original submission as an Observational Article. These changes seem appropriate.

One minor comment is that the responses to the two reviewers seem to have been swapped between the reviewers i.e. the response to Reviewer #1 is actually the response to comments by Reviewer #2 and vice versa. Since both sets of comments have been addressed, ultimately this does not cause problems in working out why changes have been made.

